# Normalize to LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, Git converts text files to CRLF when checking out on Windows.
# These books are consumed byte-for-byte: the golden tests pin every response
# exactly, and the CLI compares its committed copy against this package. CRLF
# would make every line look changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

books/*.json text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
